   "a": "Answers up to 99."
  },
  {
   "q": "What is bridging?",
   "a": "Going over a ten, like 38 + 5 = 43."
  },
  {
   "q": "How do I check 63 − 28 = 35?",
   "a": "35 + 28 = 63."
  }
